<Layout title="Cookie Policy | López Márquez Abogados" description="Information about cookies, storage and technical measurement on this website." noindex={true}>
<PageHero eyebrow="Legal information" title="Cookie Policy" description="Technologies that may be involved when using this website." />
<section class="section"><div class="container prose">
  <h2>1. Advertising cookies</h2>
  <p>This website does not use profiling to display personalised advertising. Its calculators and guidance tools run in the browser to produce their results.</p>
  <h2>2. Technical measurement</h2>
  <p>Cloudflare provides a website performance measurement tool which, according to its documentation, uses aggregated loading metrics and does not require cookies or local storage. If enabled for this domain, its purpose is technical performance measurement rather than advertising profiles.</p>
  <p>The website code does not include advertising tags from Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager, Meta Pixel or Microsoft Clarity. Technical settings applied when the page is delivered may also affect the requests visible in a browser.</p>
  <h2>3. Necessary storage</h2>
  <p>The hosting platform may process technical data needed to deliver, protect and maintain the service. Technologies that are not necessary for a requested function must be handled according to applicable consent rules before activation.</p>
  <h2>4. Policy changes</h2>
  <p>If a tool using cookies or equivalent technologies is added, this policy must be updated before activation and the appropriate choice mechanism must be provided.</p>
  <h2>5. Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy matters, email <a href="mailto:lopezmarquezabogados@gmail.com">lopezmarquezabogados@gmail.com</a>.</p>
</div></section>
</Layout>
